# web-ui/_redirects — intentionally empty.
#
# Same-origin routing is handled by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets via the
# wrangler.jsonc `assets` binding: requests that match a static file (e.g.
# /entries.html, /css/app.css, /js/api.js) are served directly; everything else
# falls through to the Worker entrypoint (which serves /api/*, /oauth/*, /share/*)
# thanks to `not_found_handling: single-page-application`.
#
# No _redirects directives are needed for this setup. The file is kept as a
# placeholder: if you ever split this into separate Pages + Worker deployments,
# add `/api/* /.netlify/functions/worker 200`-style proxy rules here.
